  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Konsultkostnad utlysning CSO 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultkostnad utlysning CSO 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment involves support in the process of announcing support of up to five million kronor to Swedish civil society organizations in 2026, including support in handling questions and answers, formalities review and initial assessment of applications. The assignment also includes compiling a report of the announcement process, support in carrying out training for new partners in RBM and support in designing the partners&apos; process for results reporting.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppdraget inneb&#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja Sida i processen f&#xf6;r utlysning av st&#xf6;d upp till fem miljoner kronor till svenska organisationer i civila samh&#xe4;llet 2026, inklusive st&#xf6;d att hantera fr&#xe5;gor och svar, granskning av formalia och en inledande bed&#xf6;mning av ans&#xf6;kningarna. I uppdraget ing&#xe5;r &#xe4;ven att sammanst&#xe4;lla en rapport av utlysnings-processen, st&#xf6;d att utf&#xf6;ra utbildning f&#xf6;r nya partners i RBM samt st&#xf6;d att utforma partners process f&#xf6;r resultatrapportering.</narrative>
  </description>
